===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*tetḱ-}}
From {{af|en|technicus|-al|lang1=la-lat}}, from {{der|en|grc|τεχνικός}}, from {{m|grc|τέχνη||skill}}.

For the late 20th-century origin of the noun sense (vehicle), see [[w:Technical (vehicle)#Etymology|Wikipedia]].

